silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_01_olog_as_typed_english_sections_01_olog_definition_spivak_kent_concrete_anchor_3_N#domesticcatbox silm:hasLongDescription "The DomesticCatBox is the noun-box a domestic cat as a concrete O_eng object. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'N', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
